ADOPTING ORDINANCE NO. 07-O-49
** As Amended **
AN ORDINANCE AMENDING, RECODIFYING, REARRANGING AND REVISING FOR RECODIFICATION
AND AMENDMENT PURPOSES THE MENTOR CODE OF ORDINANCES AS ADOPTED OCTOBER 21,
1969, AS AMENDED, AND DECLARING AN EMERGENCY
WHEREAS, the City of Mentor has heretofore entered into a contract with the
Walter H. Drane Company to prepare and publish a recodification of the City’s
ordinances, and
WHEREAS, the Mentor Planning Commission at its regular meeting of January 5,
2006 approved the changes and modifications to the zoning code as presented by
the Walter Drane Company.
NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT ORDAINED BY THE COUNCIL OF THE CITY OF MENTOR, COUNTY OF
LAKE, STATE OF OHIO:
SECTION 1. That the following Ordinances of the City of Mentor, Ohio, of a
general and permanent nature, as revised, recodified, rearranged and
consolidated into component codes, titles, chapters and sections are hereby
approved, adopted and enacted as the Codified Ordinances of Mentor, Ohio.
Existing ordinances to be revised, rearranged and consolidated:
