CHARTER OF MENTOR, OHIO
 
   EDITOR’S NOTE: The Charter of the City of Mentor was approved by the voters
on October 4, 1960. Dates appearing in parentheses following section headings
indicate that those provisions were subsequently amended, added or repealed on
the date given.
 
